    <!-- Bottom tab bar icons — 24x24 viewbox, centred, ~20x20 live area.
         Outline set = 1.8u stroke (round caps/joins) expanded to fill; filled set = same silhouette,
         interior details knocked out (Search filled = 2.4u stroke). Holes wind opposite to their
         parents, so the data renders identically under EvenOdd (default) and NonZero.
         Each string starts with the grid's corners ("M0 0ZM24 24Z", zero-area) so PathIcon's
         uniform stretch keeps the 24-grid: one box size draws every tab at the same weight. -->

